      "raw_text": "automate this slow White-box approaches [5]-[7] analyse the black-box approaches [8]-[11] Template-based tools [8], [9] mutate code-templates Model-based relational tools [10], [11] generate fully test cases (instruction sequences and inputs), and not discovered any funda- In this paper, we present a model-based ineffective in that they have no chance before they undergo any expensive leakage analysis. Our goal is to identify two different inputs so that both ex- agree on the leakage according to the leakage model model trace ), but differ on the measurements hardware trace transient in-",
